g6_pre/pg6_post. In the diff d6, 0x0670: 255->127. 0x066F was not in d6, so 0x066F unchanged (34). So indeed 0x066F stays 34.\n\nSo 0x066F is not health. Yet the routine reads it for hearts. Contradiction → my disassembly location might be off (maybe the routine at 0x6D08 is for som","truncated":true}
